# Nationwide gaps

- Storm Watch and captured weather do not establish national facility coverage.
- When a county or alert has no audited source intersection, show the gap. Do not substitute Manatee or any other county.
- A loading sweep, a partial catalog, or an unmerged branch is not completed national coverage.
- Ranked rows keep the source facts that were actually joined. Unknowns stay on screen.
